cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use oktopy, please cite it as below."
title: "oktopy: re-tested, rated claim stores for single-cell fields"
abstract: >-
  Published conclusions of a field's single-cell studies, extracted as structured claims, re-tested at donor level
  in their own data and in every other harmonised dataset, pooled, rated for certainty, and served as a claim store,
  knowledge graph, atlas and MCP server.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Marco Salas"
    given-names: "Sergio"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sergiomarco25/oktopy"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - single-cell
  - replication
  - meta-analysis
  - pseudobulk
  - knowledge graph
  - Model Context Protocol
